<!--
  The pages of webfpv.org, which are three separate services behind one
  domain: this landing page, its wiki, its patch notes and the sticker pack are a static site,
  /sim/ is the simulator's Render static site and /board/ is the board's
  Render web service, joined by the Cloudflare Worker in the simulator's
  edge/router.js.

  The wiki's articles are hash routes off /wiki/, so they cannot be listed
  here as URLs of their own. What makes them findable is the per article
  document.title in src/wiki/wiki.js and the links out of /wiki/ itself.

  Hand maintained, and short enough that it should be. A new page of this
  site goes here, and into the list in scripts/page-lint.js.
-->
